  "title": "Delicata Creamy Squash Soup",
  "description": "Roasted squash lends a delicate sweetness to this creamy soup. Onions, vegetable stock, and roasted squash are processed to a fine consistency, then combined with heavy cream, creating a heavenly smooth soup.",
  "authors": [
    "Sue Haser"
  ],
